{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_07",
  "title": "Relic of Eternal Splendor",
  "storyCode": "SS-7",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c9fc4399dd5e160d21eade77b32be7d5421f5dbd7d9512d9b04ab8da114d8401",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've gotten so good at the piano!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "D-Do you think so?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know better than anyone how much you've changed. I'm your mother, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can hear it all—how hard you've been working... I know your job must be so hectic, and yet you've kept up with your piano practice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It seems you've gone through quite a lot out there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hate to disturb you two while you're practicing! Supper's ready?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm—this is wonderful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you think? My cooking's really improved, eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't know the half of it, Sakiko... He had me taste-test so much in order to finally get to this point."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hurry and give this salad a try, hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mmh! Delicious!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've made a lot of minor adjustments so it's more to your liking! Not half bad, eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And there's plenty more dishes you love on the way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yep!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ngh... Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko? Sakiko!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh-What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think—I've had a little too much to eat..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you feeling better now...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Father",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, I think I overdid it a little..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Honestly, your father never changes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But that's his style, I suppose. Honestly, most times it's quite adorable of him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You'll forgive him, won't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He really loves you, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And so do I."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I really love the both of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mother, where is this coming from...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've been going through our photo albums more and more while you were away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I started from when you were born... then when you were one, then two, then three..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My childhood memory nearly failed me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe. But there's nothing more important, nothing more special to a parent than their child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When you were born, your palm wasn't even half as big as mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But look at you now. Yours is even a little bigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko's mother takes her hand and brings their palms together.\nFor some reason beyond herself, Sakiko grasps her mother's hand and locks fingers with hers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mother, your hand is so warm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. I'm right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mother..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go on. You can cry all you want. I always comforted you like this when you cried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? Was I... really such a crybaby?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When you were very, veeery little. Oh, you would make the biggest fuss over a single sweet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You may be a strong young woman now, but you were a big crybaby back then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "R-Really? I don't remember at all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*giggle* Your mother would never lie to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then... Do you remember my high school entrance ceremony?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course. I remember you in your school uniform. Our whole family took a photo together at the school gate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, that sounds right... Oh, that does bring me back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What else have we done together? Mother... I want you to tell me. Tell me about all the memories we share."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko, just how long have you been away from home? Aren't you the clingy one today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Home..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm... Well, if you want, I'll reminisce a little more."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now where should I begin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's start from when I was born. I want to hear it all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay, then we'll start from the day you were born..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And so, down the country path, at a leisurely pace, Sakiko and her mother walk side-by-side, and it feels as if they could walk forever.\nJust like that sweet, beautiful stretch of time they shared back when it all began. Unhurried and without end.\nTheir hands, the umbilical cord that connected them in the very beginning."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You found your way home!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Miss Vigna, this carriage seems to be out of order. Now let me down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's see... W—Wait, these controls aren't like what I learned at Rhodes Island!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, crap, crap, crap, we can't stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're going to crash!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko, out of the way—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
